  <section class="hero-comparatif">
    <div class="conteneur">
      <h1>Comparison of AZERTY layouts</h1>
      <p class="hero-comparatif__definition">
        Compare the characters you can type and the keys that change on three layouts:
        the traditional Windows AZERTY, the AFNOR AZERTY and AZERTY&nbsp;Global.
        All three keep the letters A to Z in the same order.
        <a href="/azerty-ameliore" hreflang="fr">All the improved AZERTY layouts, beyond these three<span class="visuellement-cache"> (in French)</span></a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="conteneur">
      <h2>Ten criteria, three layouts</h2>

      <div class="tableau-compare">
        <table role="table">
